WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:07.024
♪♪

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:12.217
ANTHONY MACKIE
With Sam picking up the shield,

00:00:12.217 --> 00:00:17.467
there's a lot of trepidation.
It's surprising how timely this series is.

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:18.982
It's been an
emotional experience.

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:20.662
SEBASTIAN STAN
There's all kinds of actually

00:00:20.662 --> 00:00:24.037
complex issues dealt
in this that are very applicable

00:00:24.037 --> 00:00:25.365
to the times
that we're in.

00:00:25.365 --> 00:00:27.717
MALCOLM SPELLMAN
It really does make you feel like

00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:30.218
you've stepped into
something that's bigger than you.

00:00:31.251 --> 00:00:33.634
KARI SKOGLAND
The goal was to be very grounded,

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:38.310
so that the super side of it
became embedded in character.

00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:42.354
We were inspired by
a team that flies through canyons.

00:00:42.354 --> 00:00:45.462
We spent several days
pushing people out of planes.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.664
NATE MOORE
There was a lot of thinking that went into

00:00:49.664 --> 00:00:52.594
how to get you into Puerto Rico
and to figure out how to make it work

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.196
seamlessly with the
stuff that we'd shot in Prague.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.638
ANTHONY MACKIE
Oh, let's roll again, I'm on!

00:00:57.638 --> 00:00:59.506
KARI SKOGLAND
To be here with all the toys

00:00:59.506 --> 00:01:02.615
and with the actors who
bring it all alive is just

00:01:02.615 --> 00:01:03.981
absolutely overwhelming.

00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:05.919
[Laughing]

00:01:05.928 --> 00:01:08.001
KARI SKOGLAND
We can't be having this much fun. [Laughs]

